Table 5: Comprehensive evaluation results comparing ICAT-S and ICAT-A variants using Llama-3.1-8B as the coverage model. Results show performance across different LLMs using both corpus-based and web-based retrieval methods, demonstrating consistent improvements in factuality and coverage scores when using web search compared to corpus-based retrieval. The table highlights how different retrieval methods affect both factuality (Sfact) and coverage scores across various model architectures.

