<span id="page-14-0"></span>Figure 5: Subtopic coverage prompt used to identify which subtopics are covered in a given text. The prompt instructs the model to analyze a list of atomic claims and return covered subtopics with supporting evidence in a structured JSON format. Each response must include topic IDs and corresponding fact numbers that explicitly appear in the text.

<span id="page-14-1"></span>Figure 6: Claim generation prompt designed to extract atomic factual statements from input text. The prompt emphasizes the importance of creating decontextualized, self-explanatory sentences with resolved pronouns and independent context, ensuring each generated claim can stand alone as a verifiable statement.

